DigiTwin is research-grade software. It is not a medical device, has not
been cleared or approved by any regulatory body, and must not be used for
diagnosis or treatment.

No patient data is contained in this repository. Clinical inputs are read
only from paths outside the repository tree and are never committed.

Third-party data: src/digitwin/data/strength_v0.csv and strength_v0_donors.csv
are derived from "Dataset on cadaveric human abdominal aorta aneurysm
biomechanics (uniaxial) and histology" by Gomes VC et al., Mendeley Data v3,
doi:10.17632/x64srrc39p.3, licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The values were changed (unit
conversion, recomputation, flags); see src/digitwin/data/STRENGTH_V0_SOURCES.md.
These files are not covered by the Apache License.

